# Effective allowlist for a build from the repository root.
**
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/LICENSING.md
!protocol/
!protocol/**
!experimental/
experimental/**
!experimental/rust-server/
experimental/rust-server/**
!experimental/rust-server/Cargo.toml
!experimental/rust-server/Cargo.lock
!experimental/rust-server/src/
!experimental/rust-server/src/**
!experimental/rust-server/tests/
!experimental/rust-server/tests/**
!experimental/rust-server/DEPENDENCIES.json
!experimental/rust-server/licenses/
!experimental/rust-server/licenses/**
# Defense in depth if generated/private files appear under an allowed subtree.
**/target
**/build-temp
**/cargo-home
**/test-state
**/tmp
**/secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.zip
**/*.log
